# round B86 (w245): the graphs' one-hop propagation of GO over the coexpression graph and the union (YPD_bx_gonbr, target_graph_feature_store.py, 4,726 columns: the neighbor mean of the propagated GO multi-hot and log1p of the covered-neighbor count) on the w167 recipe (GO alone, 0.203). INDUCTIVE: no label and no measurement enters; the row of a pinned gene is built exactly as a training gene's. The CPU ladder read it at 0.279 by forest against 0.187 for GO alone (store_baselines_betaxanthin_nbr.json). Paired against w167 by seed. Six seeds at 36 GB.
